msgid ""
"Replace ``ROLE`` with ``staff`` or ``student``, ``ATTRIBUTE`` with an "
"attribute from :ref:`configuration-anonymization`, and ``SCHOOL`` with "
"the school abbreviation."
msgstr ""
"Ersetzen Sie ``ROLE`` durch ``staff`` oder ``student``, ``ATTRIBUTE`` durch "
"ein Attribut aus :ref:`configuration-anonymization` und ``SCHOOL`` durch das "
"Schulkürzel."

#: ../../configuration.rst:342
msgid ""
"The update drops an LDAP filter for a school that wasn't on the former "
"school list, because the connector didn't synchronize that school."
msgstr ""
"Das Update verwirft einen LDAP-Filter für eine Schule, die nicht auf der "
"bisherigen Schulliste stand, weil der Connector diese Schule nicht "
"synchronisiert hat."

#: ../../configuration.rst:346
msgid ""
"Without ``asm/username``, the update has no account to assign schools to. "
"It keeps ``asm/school_whitelist`` and the "
"``asm/ldap_filter/students/SCHOOL`` and ``asm/ldap_filter/staff/SCHOOL`` "
"UCR variables and prints a note for each of them. Move their values to the "
"settings file when you add the account."
msgstr ""
"Ohne ``asm/username`` hat das Update kein Konto, dem es Schulen zuordnen "
"kann. Es behält ``asm/school_whitelist`` und die UCR-Variablen "
"``asm/ldap_filter/students/SCHOOL`` und ``asm/ldap_filter/staff/SCHOOL`` "
"und gibt für jede einen Hinweis aus. Übertragen Sie ihre Werte in die "
"Einstellungsdatei, wenn Sie das Konto anlegen."

#: ../../configuration.rst:354
msgid ""
"If :file:`/etc/asm-connections.json` already exists, the update leaves it"
" and the UCR variables unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Wenn :file:`/etc/asm-connections.json` bereits existiert, lässt das Update "
"die Datei und die UCR-Variablen unverändert."

